[{"id":4416113023,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBziJfw","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?u=9b90963f1b4f17720e50bbbe495fbe8c84c8bc8e&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I'm not familiar with the code for RichTextLabel, but as far as I've tested it, I think it works as intended.\r\n\r\nAdding a virtual character might feel a bit like a bit hacky. Instead of adding a virtual character, would it be difficult to record the height somewhere and reuse that value? However, since I’m not familiar with TextServer, I can’t say for sure.\r\n\r\n> It is reproducible in 4.6.3, 4.6 and 4.5 (have not tested other versions, but likely a regression in 4.4), the screenshot in the issue seems to use different fallback font for some reason.\r\n\r\nMaybe it's because of using the modern theme in 4.7?","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119987#pullrequestreview-4416113023","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119987","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119